{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# Creating a Customer Service Agent com cliente-Side Tools\n\nIn este recipe, we'll demonstrate como para criar a customer service chatbot using Claude 3 plus cliente-side tools. The chatbot will be able para look up customer information, retrieve order details, e cancelar orders on behalf of the customer. We'll define the necessary tools e simulate synthetic responses para showcase the chatbot's capabilities."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Step 1: definir up the environment\n\nprimeiro, let's instalar the obrigatório libraries e definir up the Anthropic api cliente."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": nulo,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "%pip install anthropic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 18,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "importar anthropic\n",
        "\n",
        "client = anthropic.Client()\n",
        "MODEL_NAME = \"claude-3-opus-20240229\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Step 2: Define the cliente-side tools\n\npróximo, we'll define the cliente-side tools aquele our chatbot will use para assist customers. We'll criar three tools: get_customer_info, get_order_details, e cancel_order."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 2,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "tools = [\n",
        "    {\n",
        "        \"nome\": \"get_customer_info\",\n",
        "        \"Descrição\": \"Retrieves customer information based on their customer ID. Retorna the customer's nome, email, and phone número.\",\n",
        "        \"input_schema\": {\n",
        "            \"tipo\": \"objeto\",\n",
        "            \"Propriedades\": {\n",
        "                \"customer_id\": {\n",
        "                    \"tipo\": \"texto\",\n",
        "                    \"Descrição\": \"The unique identifier para the customer.\"\n",
        "                }\n",
        "            },\n",
        "            \"required\": [\"customer_id\"]\n",
        "        }\n",
        "    },\n",
        "    {\n",
        "        \"nome\": \"get_order_details\",\n",
        "        \"Descrição\": \"Retrieves the details of a specific order based on the order ID. Retorna the order ID, product nome, quantity, price, and order status.\",\n",
        "        \"input_schema\": {\n",
        "            \"tipo\": \"objeto\",\n",
        "            \"Propriedades\": {\n",
        "                \"order_id\": {\n",
        "                    \"tipo\": \"texto\",\n",
        "                    \"Descrição\": \"The unique identifier para the order.\"\n",
        "                }\n",
        "            },\n",
        "            \"required\": [\"order_id\"]\n",
        "        }\n",
        "    },\n",
        "    {\n",
        "        \"nome\": \"cancel_order\",\n",
        "        \"Descrição\": \"Cancels an order based on the provided order ID. Retorna a confirmation message se the cancellation is successful.\",\n",
        "        \"input_schema\": {\n",
        "            \"tipo\": \"objeto\",\n",
        "            \"Propriedades\": {\n",
        "                \"order_id\": {\n",
        "                    \"tipo\": \"texto\",\n",
        "                    \"Descrição\": \"The unique identifier para the order to be cancelled.\"\n",
        "                }\n",
        "            },\n",
        "            \"required\": [\"order_id\"]\n",
        "        }\n",
        "    }\n",
        "]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Step 3: Simulate synthetic tool responses\n\nSince we don't have real customer data ou order information, we'll simulate synthetic responses para our tools. In a real-world scenario, estes funções would interact com your actual customer banco de dados e order management system."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 15,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "def get_customer_info(customer_id):\n",
        "    # Simulated customer data\n",
        "    customers = {\n",
        "        \"C1\": {\"nome\": \"John Doe\", \"email\": \"john@example.com\", \"phone\": \"123-456-7890\"},\n",
        "        \"C2\": {\"nome\": \"Jane Smith\", \"email\": \"jane@example.com\", \"phone\": \"987-654-3210\"}\n",
        "    }\n",
        "    retornar customers.obter(customer_id, \"Customer not found\")\n",
        "\n",
        "def get_order_details(order_id):\n",
        "    # Simulated order data\n",
        "    orders = {\n",
        "        \"O1\": {\"id\": \"O1\", \"product\": \"Widget A\", \"quantity\": 2, \"price\": 19.99, \"status\": \"Shipped\"},\n",
        "        \"O2\": {\"id\": \"O2\", \"product\": \"Gadget B\", \"quantity\": 1, \"price\": 49.99, \"status\": \"Processing\"}\n",
        "    }\n",
        "    retornar orders.obter(order_id, \"Order not found\")\n",
        "\n",
        "def cancel_order(order_id):\n",
        "    # Simulated order cancellation\n",
        "    se order_id in [\"O1\", \"O2\"]:\n",
        "        retornar verdadeiro\n",
        "    senão:\n",
        "        retornar falso"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Step 4: processo tool calls e retorna results\n\nWe'll criar a função para processo the tool calls made by Claude e retorna the appropriate results."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 4,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "def process_tool_call(tool_name, tool_input):\n",
        "    se tool_name == \"get_customer_info\":\n",
        "        retornar get_customer_info(tool_input[\"customer_id\"])\n",
        "    elif tool_name == \"get_order_details\":\n",
        "        retornar get_order_details(tool_input[\"order_id\"])\n",
        "    elif tool_name == \"cancel_order\":\n",
        "        retornar cancel_order(tool_input[\"order_id\"])"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Step 5: Interact com the chatbot\n\nagora, let's criar a função para interact com the chatbot. We'll enviar a usuário message, processo any tool calls made by Claude, e retorna the final resposta para the usuário."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 13,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "importar json\n",
        "\n",
        "def chatbot_interaction(user_message):\n",
        "    imprimir(f\"\\n{'='*50}\\nUser Message: {user_message}\\n{'='*50}\")\n",
        "\n",
        "    messages = [\n",
        "        {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": user_message}\n",
        "    ]\n",
        "\n",
        "    response = client.messages.create(\n",
        "        model=MODEL_NAME,\n",
        "        max_tokens=4096,\n",
        "        tools=tools,\n",
        "        messages=messages\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "    imprimir(f\"\\nInitial Response:\")\n",
        "    imprimir(f\"Stop Reason: {response.stop_reason}\")\n",
        "    imprimir(f\"Content: {response.content}\")\n",
        "\n",
        "    enquanto response.stop_reason == \"tool_use\":\n",
        "        tool_use = next(block para block in response.content se block.tipo == \"tool_use\")\n",
        "        tool_name = tool_use.nome\n",
        "        tool_input = tool_use.entrada\n",
        "\n",
        "        imprimir(f\"\\nTool Used: {tool_name}\")\n",
        "        imprimir(f\"Tool entrada:\")\n",
        "        imprimir(json.dumps(tool_input, indent=2))\n",
        "\n",
        "        tool_result = process_tool_call(tool_name, tool_input)\n",
        "\n",
        "        imprimir(f\"\\nTool Result:\")\n",
        "        imprimir(json.dumps(tool_result, indent=2))\n",
        "\n",
        "        messages = [\n",
        "            {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": user_message},\n",
        "            {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": response.content},\n",
        "            {\n",
        "                \"role\": \"user\",\n",
        "                \"content\": [\n",
        "                    {\n",
        "                        \"tipo\": \"tool_result\",\n",
        "                        \"tool_use_id\": tool_use.id,\n",
        "                        \"content\": str(tool_result),\n",
        "                    }\n",
        "                ],\n",
        "            },\n",
        "        ]\n",
        "\n",
        "        response = client.messages.create(\n",
        "            model=MODEL_NAME,\n",
        "            max_tokens=4096,\n",
        "            tools=tools,\n",
        "            messages=messages\n",
        "        )\n",
        "\n",
        "        imprimir(f\"\\nResponse:\")\n",
        "        imprimir(f\"Stop Reason: {response.stop_reason}\")\n",
        "        imprimir(f\"Content: {response.content}\")\n",
        "\n",
        "    final_response = next(\n",
        "        (block.text para block in response.content se hasattr(block, \"text\")),\n",
        "        None,\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "    imprimir(f\"\\nFinal Response: {final_response}\")\n",
        "\n",
        "    retornar final_response"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Step 6: teste the chatbot\nLet's teste our customer service chatbot com a poucos sample queries."
