    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "e aquele's isso! We've created a customer service chatbot using Claude 3 models e cliente-side tools. The chatbot can look up customer information, retrieve order details, e cancelar orders based on the usuário's requests. By defining limpar tool descriptions e schemas, we enable Claude para effectively understand e utilize the available tools para assist customers.\n\nFeel free para expand on Este exemplo by integrating com your actual customer banco de dados e order management system, e by adding mais tools para handle a wider range of customer service tasks."
      ]
